Sound
  All music and effects are synthesised by engine/audio.py. No samples or recordings.

Picture
  All imagery is drawn in code by engine/brand.js and the film pages. The emblem is a
  redrawing of Greenwave Society's own logo (public/logo-full.png).

Tools
  Chromium via playwright-core (Apache 2.0), ffmpeg (LGPL/GPL), numpy (BSD).
